direction: down
"derived-credit": "derived-credit\nAtomic exchange owns one coalescible batch;\nconcurrent publications remain pending; no load-\nthen-clear and no count-from-bit inference"
"cas": "cas\nOne strong CAS on coherent unsigned gate snapshot;\nfailure updates expected but grants no pin/route\naccess; bounded fallback only for admitted reason"
"overflow": "overflow\nCount saturation denies before increment; no field\ncarry or modular generation reuse; exhausted\ngeneration seals slot"
"storage-commit": "storage-commit\nTarget VM lease, handler pins, selected work and\nold-roster/native retirement receipts must close\nbefore VM deletion"
"mailbox": "mailbox\nProcess-lifetime shell owns denied reasons after old\nVM retirement; mailbox contains no Scheme/VM pointer\nand survives completion of old batch"
"semantic": "semantic\nOnly process-scoped coalescible native reasons with\ngeneration-invariant meaning admit this fallback;\nsource behavior alone does not prove policy\nequivalence"
"binding": "binding\nNormal process custodian explicitly authorizes batch\ntarget under lease; unknown decision retains\noriginal lease, never auto-rebinds next VM"
"participant": "participant\nBound work keeps real target VM and old roster\nserviceable; semantic mailbox bits are not sync-op\ncompletion"
"overflow" -> "cas"
"semantic" -> "cas"
"semantic" -> "derived-credit"
"derived-credit" -> "mailbox"
"mailbox" -> "binding"
"semantic" -> "binding"
"binding" -> "storage-commit"
"cas" -> "storage-commit"
"participant" -> "storage-commit"
"binding" -> "participant"
proof: "SysML -> ASCENT -> QNT / Lean; source + platform OPEN"
"storage-commit" -> proof
gain0: "gate-cost\nLogical operation counts only; packing must be lock-\nfree and all fields use the same atomic protocol"
proof -> gain0
gain1: "batching\nOnly equivalent reason effects may merge; counted\npayloads and policy-dependent identities require other\ntransport"
proof -> gain1
gain2: "lifetime\nMailbox does not eliminate required roots for VM-\nspecific payloads; no automatic new-generation target"
proof -> gain2
gain3: "language\nZig cannot remove CAS, coalescing, policy or lifetime\nproofs; no extra language net benefit established"
proof -> gain3
